Description: Romanized Burmese input method for IBus
 Myangler is an IBus engine that converts romanized Burmese
 keystrokes into Burmese (Myanmar) text. The bundled Preferences
 application uses GTK4 and libadwaita to expose the same toggles,
 sliders, and history controls as the upstream macOS build.
 .
 Add the engine via Settings -> Region & Language -> Manage
 Installed Languages -> Input Sources after installing this
 package and restarting IBus.
